# ── Portfolio chatbot (api/chat.ts) ────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to ".env" for local testing, or set these in Vercel:
#   Vercel dashboard → your project → Settings → Environment Variables
#
# WITHOUT a key, the chatbot still works — it falls back to smart
# pre-written answers. Add a key to turn on real AI (Claude).

# Your Anthropic API key. Get one at https://console.anthropic.com
# New accounts include free trial credit.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here

# Optional: which Claude model answers. Defaults to fast + cheap Haiku.
# Use claude-opus-4-8 for the highest-quality (pricier) answers.
# CHAT_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
